Thought: Test a best_single strategy with ETS, the top-ranked model, to see if a single strong model beats combinations.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"best_single","model":"ETS"}

Thought: Test a trimmed‑mean over the full pool (pool_full) with 20% trimming to see if a robust average of all models improves over the current leader.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"trimmed_mean","pool":"pool_full","trim_pct":0.2}

Thought: Test a weighted strategy using the existing gradient‑boosted weights (w1) on the more diverse pool2 to see if adding ONLY_CWT_catboost and ONLY_FT_rf helps.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","models":["ARIMA","ETS","THETA","CWT_catboost","ONLY_CWT_catboost","ONLY_FT_rf"],"weights":"w1"}

