Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool1"}

Thought: Test a DBA approach on the moderately sized pool2 to see if it can outperform the current mean pool1 baseline.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool2","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Test a simple mean over pool4 to see if adding ONLY_FT_rf improves over pool1 mean.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"mean","pool":"pool4"}

Thought: Test a robust median over the moderately sized pool2 to see if it beats the weighted baseline.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool2"}

Thought: Test a trimmed‑mean on the larger pool4 to see if trimming outliers improves over the plain mean.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"trimmed_mean","pool":"pool4","trim_pct":0.2}

Thought: Evaluate a median combination on pool3 to see if a simple robust aggregate improves over current best.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool3"}

